TI  - Time-managed PAPR use enables a balanced approach to infection control and personal freedom
T2  - SCIENTIFIC REPORTS
LA  - English
KW  - PAPR for everyone
KW  - Powered air-purifying respirator (PAPR)
KW  - Engineering alternative to lockdown
KW  - Saved allowance time (SAT)
KW  - Airborne infectious disease
KW  - Non-pharmaceutical intervention (NPI)
KW  - Verifiable record of AI output
