TI  - A machine learning-Powered digital twin framework for adaptive management of urban air quality in Chiang Mai, Northern Thailand
T2  - ENGINEERING APPLICATIONS OF ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Artificial intelligence for environmental control
KW  - Air quality management
KW  - Digital twin framework
KW  - Internet of Things
KW  - Deep learning for pollution forecasting
KW  - Adaptive policy optimization
