TI  - Using explainable machine learning to better understand the environmental and socioeconomic contributions to preterm birth
T2  - ENVIRONMENTAL POLLUTION
LA  - English
KW  - Prenatal environmental exposures
KW  - Predictive factors
KW  - Heterogeneous effects
