TI  - Dynamic weighting and genetic algorithm-based hybrid SVR-Ridge model for improving PM2.5 forecasting in open-pit copper mines
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF MINING RECLAMATION AND ENVIRONMENT
LA  - English
